WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Today puts the work queue and current blockers in view. Choose a task to continue the work.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The pipeline groups opportunities by work that needs you, work BrostCo is handling, and work waiting on others. Use a simple board, a list, all stages, or a table to organize the same opportunities.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Keep the opportunity and its decision brief together while you review. Pursue, pass, or open the full record. Your decision stays connected to the opportunity.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Search the roster by company, trade, or location. Open filters when you need a narrower view. Open the subcontractor record to follow its opportunities, conversations, and required paperwork.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
The opportunity brings its identity, deadline, owner, and next action together. Expand readiness to find remaining work. Your team handles final review, signatures, and submission.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
The activity history brings actions, messages, and outcomes into a readable account record. Open event details and the related record to understand what happened and what needs attention.
